#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: description
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"An introduction to a course designed to guide teams and organizations early "
"in their launch of quantum initiatives."
msgstr ""
"Pengenalan kepada kursus yang direka untuk memandu pasukan dan organisasi di"
" peringkat awal pelancaran inisiatif kuantum mereka."

#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: title
#, no-wrap
msgid "Introduction"
msgstr "Pengenalan"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "{/* cspell:ignore bootcamps hackathons */}\n"
msgstr "{/* cspell:ignore bootcamps hackathons */}\n"

#. type: Title #
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Welcome {#welcome}"
msgstr "Selamat datang {#welcome}"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Welcome to Designing and Leading Quantum Projects, a course designed to "
"inform teams and organizations on how to develop capabilities required for "
"realizing quantum initiatives.\n"
msgstr ""
"Selamat datang ke Mereka Bentuk dan Memimpin Projek Kuantum, sebuah kursus "
"yang direka untuk memaklumkan pasukan dan organisasi tentang cara "
"membangunkan keupayaan yang diperlukan untuk merealisasikan inisiatif "
"kuantum.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"This course is intended for academic, business, and organizational "
"leadership in the early stages of building quantum projects. The lessons "
"will cover common developmental stages and best practices identified by "
"successful innovators in the field. Most of the content will be applicable "
"across quantum projects broadly, though a few topics will be specific to a "
"particular type of partnership. For example, grant writing might be more "
"often applicable to academic researchers, though grants for startups and "
"enterprises are also important in this ecosystem.\n"
msgstr ""
"Kursus ini ditujukan untuk kepimpinan akademik, perniagaan, dan organisasi "
"di peringkat awal membina projek kuantum. Pelajaran akan merangkumi "
"peringkat pembangunan biasa dan amalan terbaik yang dikenal pasti oleh "
"inovator berjaya dalam bidang ini. Kebanyakan kandungan akan terpakai "
"merentasi projek kuantum secara umum, walaupun beberapa topik akan khusus "
"kepada jenis perkongsian tertentu. Sebagai contoh, penulisan geran mungkin "
"lebih kerap terpakai kepada penyelidik akademik, walaupun geran untuk "
"syarikat permulaan dan perusahaan juga penting dalam ekosistem ini.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"This course is mostly non-technical. Technical jargon is limited to "
"descriptions of concrete example workflows, example wording for grant "
"proposals, and discussion of realistic deliverables and their constraints.\n"
msgstr ""
"Kursus ini sebahagian besarnya bukan teknikal. Jargon teknikal terhad kepada"
" penerangan aliran kerja contoh konkrit, contoh ungkapan untuk cadangan "
"geran, dan perbincangan tentang hasil yang realistik dan kekangan mereka.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "The contents are organized as follows:\n"
msgstr "Kandungannya disusun seperti berikut:\n"

#. type: Bullet: '* '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Introduction\n"
msgstr "Pengenalan\n"

#. type: Bullet: '* '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Early stages - things to consider and have in place prior to large purchases"
" of quantum computing time, and prior to standing up a team\n"
msgstr ""
"Peringkat awal - perkara yang perlu dipertimbangkan dan disediakan sebelum "
"pembelian besar masa pengkomputeran kuantum, dan sebelum menubuhkan "
"pasukan\n"

#. type: Bullet: '* '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Standing up a team - key roles and responsibilities, attributes of "
"successful teams\n"
msgstr ""
"Menubuhkan pasukan - peranan dan tanggungjawab utama, atribut pasukan yang "
"berjaya\n"

#. type: Bullet: '* '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Grant writing - mapping best practices in general for grant writing in the "
"context of quantum computing\n"
msgstr ""
"Penulisan geran - memetakan amalan terbaik secara umum untuk penulisan geran"
" dalam konteks pengkomputeran kuantum\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Join us for this deep dive into building successful quantum projects!\n"
msgstr ""
"Sertai kami untuk menyelami lebih dalam cara membina projek kuantum yang "
"berjaya!\n"

#. type: Title ##
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Key players and audience {#key-players-and-audience}"
msgstr "Pemain utama dan audiens {#key-players-and-audience}"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Below is a brief description of several key players in this ecosystem and "
"potential audiences for this course.\n"
msgstr ""
"Di bawah adalah penerangan ringkas tentang beberapa pemain utama dalam "
"ekosistem ini dan bakal audiens untuk kursus ini.\n"

#. type: Title ###
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "The IBM Quantum Network {#the-ibm-quantum-network}"
msgstr "Rangkaian IBM Quantum {#the-ibm-quantum-network}"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"The IBM Quantum Network is a worldwide collective shaping the future of "
"quantum computing. The hundreds of partners in the Network include Fortune "
"500 companies, universities, laboratories, and startups, all helping to "
"build a quantum economy. Partnership in the Network includes access to "
"exclusive meetings and select channels where the latest ideas in quantum are"
" shared. IBM Quantum Network partners collaborate even outside these events,"
" and benefit from close working relationships.\n"
msgstr ""
"Rangkaian IBM Quantum adalah kolektif seluruh dunia yang membentuk masa "
"depan pengkomputeran kuantum. Ratusan rakan kongsi dalam Rangkaian ini "
"termasuk syarikat Fortune 500, universiti, makmal, dan syarikat permulaan, "
"semuanya membantu membina ekonomi kuantum. Perkongsian dalam Rangkaian ini "
"termasuk akses kepada mesyuarat eksklusif dan saluran terpilih di mana idea "
"terbaru dalam kuantum dikongsi. Rakan kongsi Rangkaian IBM Quantum "
"bekerjasama walaupun di luar acara-acara ini, dan mendapat manfaat daripada "
"hubungan kerja yang rapat.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Every partner in the IBM Quantum Network is different, but some coarse-"
"binned categories are useful for context, such as startups, global systems "
"integrators (GSIs), academic institutions, non-academic research "
"institutions, and large enterprises.\n"
msgstr ""
"Setiap rakan kongsi dalam Rangkaian IBM Quantum adalah berbeza, tetapi "
"beberapa kategori kasar berguna untuk konteks, seperti syarikat permulaan, "
"pengintegral sistem global (GSI), institusi akademik, institusi penyelidikan"
" bukan akademik, dan perusahaan besar.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Many of the guidelines and practices shared in this course were developed "
"and field-tested by partners in the IBM Quantum Network.\n"
msgstr ""
"Banyak panduan dan amalan yang dikongsi dalam kursus ini dibangunkan dan "
"diuji lapangan oleh rakan kongsi dalam Rangkaian IBM Quantum.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"**Startups:** Startups are agile, innovation‑driven companies that rapidly "
"turn new ideas into scalable business solutions. In the quantum computing "
"ecosystem, they play a pivotal role by accelerating technical breakthroughs,"
" commercializing niche capabilities, and bridging cutting‑edge research with"
" real‑world applications. Their speed and specialization help catalyze "
"growth across the entire industry.\n"
msgstr ""
"**Syarikat permulaan:** Syarikat permulaan adalah syarikat yang tangkas dan "
"didorong inovasi yang dengan cepat mengubah idea baru kepada penyelesaian "
"perniagaan berskala. Dalam ekosistem pengkomputeran kuantum, mereka "
"memainkan peranan penting dengan mempercepatkan terobosan teknikal, "
"mengkomersialkan keupayaan niche, dan menjembatani penyelidikan terkini "
"dengan aplikasi dunia nyata. Kelajuan dan pengkhususan mereka membantu "
"memangkin pertumbuhan di seluruh industri.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"**Global systems integrators (GSIs):** Global systems integrators (GSIs) are"
" large, end‑to‑end technology and services firms that help organizations "
"modernize, integrate, and scale complex digital solutions. In the quantum "
"computing ecosystem, they play a crucial role by enabling enterprise‑grade "
"adoption at a global scale. Their broad industry reach helps turn quantum "
"innovation into operational impact.\n"
msgstr ""
"**Pengintegral sistem global (GSI):** Pengintegral sistem global (GSI) "
"adalah firma teknologi dan perkhidmatan hujung ke hujung yang besar, yang "
"membantu organisasi memodenkan, mengintegrasikan, dan menskalakan "
"penyelesaian digital yang kompleks. Dalam ekosistem pengkomputeran kuantum, "
"mereka memainkan peranan penting dengan membolehkan penggunaan peringkat "
"perusahaan pada skala global. Jangkauan industri mereka yang luas membantu "
"mengubah inovasi kuantum kepada impak operasi.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"**Academic institutions:** These are universities, colleges, or consortia of"
" educational institutions. In the quantum computing ecosystem, they play a "
"central role by pushing the boundaries of theory and experimentation while "
"training the next generation of quantum scientists and engineers. Their "
"discoveries and expertise form the bedrock on which other organizations can "
"build their quantum impact.\n"
msgstr ""
"**Institusi akademik:** Ini adalah universiti, kolej, atau konsortium "
"institusi pendidikan. Dalam ekosistem pengkomputeran kuantum, mereka "
"memainkan peranan utama dengan menolak sempadan teori dan eksperimen sambil "
"melatih generasi seterusnya saintis dan jurutera kuantum. Penemuan dan "
"kepakaran mereka membentuk asas di mana organisasi lain dapat membina impak "
"kuantum mereka.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"**Research institutions:** These are specialized organizations, like "
"national labs, focused on advancing scientific and technical knowledge "
"through dedicated, often mission‑driven R&D. In the quantum computing "
"ecosystem, they play a vital role by generating breakthrough discoveries, "
"developing enabling technologies, and providing deep domain expertise that "
"fuels innovation across industry and academia. Their educational initiatives"
" are often focused more on training rising researchers and less on classroom"
" education.\n"
msgstr ""
"**Institusi penyelidikan:** Ini adalah organisasi khusus, seperti makmal "
"kebangsaan, yang tertumpu pada memajukan pengetahuan saintifik dan teknikal "
"melalui R&D yang berdedikasi, sering didorong misi. Dalam ekosistem "
"pengkomputeran kuantum, mereka memainkan peranan penting dengan menjana "
"penemuan terobosan, membangunkan teknologi pemboleh, dan menyediakan "
"kepakaran domain mendalam yang mendorong inovasi merentasi industri dan "
"akademia. Inisiatif pendidikan mereka sering lebih tertumpu pada latihan "
"penyelidik muda berbanding pendidikan bilik darjah.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"**Enterprise organizations:** Enterprise organizations are established "
"companies that apply technology to solve real business challenges, optimize "
"operations, and create competitive advantage at scale. In the quantum "
"computing ecosystem, they play a key role by identifying high‑value use "
"cases, funding applied innovation, and piloting solutions that demonstrate "
"measurable impact in real‑world environments.\n"
msgstr ""
"**Organisasi perusahaan:** Organisasi perusahaan adalah syarikat mapan yang "
"menggunakan teknologi untuk menyelesaikan cabaran perniagaan sebenar, "
"mengoptimumkan operasi, dan mewujudkan kelebihan kompetitif pada skala. "
"Dalam ekosistem pengkomputeran kuantum, mereka memainkan peranan utama "
"dengan mengenal pasti kes penggunaan bernilai tinggi, mendanai inovasi "
"gunaan, dan mempercontohi penyelesaian yang menunjukkan impak yang boleh "
"diukur dalam persekitaran dunia nyata.\n"

#. type: Title ###
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Quantum Innovation Centers {#quantum-innovation-centers}"
msgstr "Pusat Inovasi Kuantum {#quantum-innovation-centers}"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"**Quantum Innovation Centers (QICs)** serve as elite centers of expertise in"
" the growing and ever-changing quantum ecosystem. Many operate as a hub, an "
"industry or academic leader growing a quantum community by partnering with "
"IBM&reg; directly, and serving as a central contact point for other "
"organizations. The QIC itself may be any of the organization types mentioned"
" above (academic institution, large enterprise, and so on).\n"
msgstr ""
"**Pusat Inovasi Kuantum (QIC)** berfungsi sebagai pusat kepakaran elit dalam"
" ekosistem kuantum yang semakin berkembang dan sentiasa berubah. Ramai yang "
"beroperasi sebagai hab, pemimpin industri atau akademik yang menumbuhkan "
"komuniti kuantum dengan bermitra langsung dengan IBM&reg;, dan berfungsi "
"sebagai titik hubungan pusat untuk organisasi lain. QIC itu sendiri boleh "
"merupakan mana-mana jenis organisasi yang disebutkan di atas (institusi "
"akademik, perusahaan besar, dan sebagainya).\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"The resulting community around an IBM QIC has the potential to meet local "
"needs through a bottom-up approach, to offer a wider variety of quantum "
"computing access plans, and to leverage the community for broader expertise."
" This can be especially important for smaller organizations and startups. As"
" an IBM QIC, you establish your leadership in the field and build important "
"industry connections - and you are contributing to the ongoing growth of the"
" quantum community. **Collaborating with a QIC could facilitate more "
"competitive applications for governmental and private funding.**\n"
msgstr ""
"Komuniti yang terhasil di sekitar IBM QIC berpotensi untuk memenuhi "
"keperluan tempatan melalui pendekatan bawah ke atas, menawarkan pelbagai "
"pelan akses pengkomputeran kuantum yang lebih luas, dan memanfaatkan "
"komuniti untuk kepakaran yang lebih luas. Ini boleh menjadi sangat penting "
"untuk organisasi yang lebih kecil dan syarikat permulaan. Sebagai IBM QIC, "
"anda menetapkan kepimpinan anda dalam bidang ini dan membina hubungan "
"industri yang penting - dan anda menyumbang kepada pertumbuhan berterusan "
"komuniti kuantum. **Bekerjasama dengan QIC boleh memudahkan permohonan yang "
"lebih kompetitif untuk pembiayaan kerajaan dan swasta.**\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Some QICs have their own IBM Quantum system on premises. This can be very "
"important when, for example, working with data that cannot legally or "
"responsibly be shared over the Internet, or across international borders.\n"
msgstr ""
"Sesetengah QIC mempunyai sistem IBM Quantum mereka sendiri di premis. Ini "
"boleh sangat penting apabila, misalnya, bekerja dengan data yang tidak boleh"
" secara sah atau bertanggungjawab dikongsi melalui Internet, atau merentasi "
"sempadan antarabangsa.\n"

#. type: Title ###
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "The quantum community {#the-quantum-community}"
msgstr "Komuniti kuantum {#the-quantum-community}"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"The broader community is driving quantum computing forward by lowering "
"barriers to entry and amplifying impact through both education and open-"
"source tooling. At universities, community-led teaching initiatives - like "
"bootcamps, hackathons, open syllabi, and student clubs - equip learners with"
" hands-on skills early, align curricula with fast-moving industry practices,"
" and create on-ramps for diverse talent to contribute. At the same time, "
"community contributions to Qiskit code, its documentation, and the IBM "
"Quantum Learning platform, make best practices discoverable and shorten the "
"path from idea to implementation. Together, this virtuous cycle of open "
"education and open-source development expands the talent pipeline, "
"standardizes shared tooling, and turns cutting-edge quantum concepts into "
"accessible, collaborative progress.\n"
msgstr ""
"Komuniti yang lebih luas mendorong pengkomputeran kuantum ke hadapan dengan "
"merendahkan halangan untuk masuk dan memperkuatkan impak melalui pendidikan "
"dan alatan sumber terbuka. Di universiti, inisiatif pengajaran yang dipimpin"
" komuniti - seperti bootcamp, hackathon, silibus terbuka, dan kelab pelajar "
"- melengkapkan pelajar dengan kemahiran praktikal awal, menyelaraskan "
"kurikulum dengan amalan industri yang bergerak pantas, dan mewujudkan laluan"
" masuk untuk bakat yang pelbagai untuk menyumbang. Pada masa yang sama, "
"sumbangan komuniti kepada kod Qiskit, dokumentasinya, dan platform IBM "
"Quantum Learning, menjadikan amalan terbaik mudah ditemui dan memendekkan "
"laluan dari idea ke implementasi. Bersama-sama, kitaran berbudi ini antara "
"pendidikan terbuka dan pembangunan sumber terbuka mengembangkan saluran "
"bakat, menyeragamkan alatan bersama, dan mengubah konsep kuantum terkini "
"kepada kemajuan kolaboratif yang mudah diakses.\n"
